{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000000577","bookName":"El heredero perdido: Una venganza navideña","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000001205/42000001205.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":4971542,"followCount":205681,"introduction":"En Nochebuena, un simple empleado de mantenimiento es abandonado por su prometida, después de que ella le robe su patente revolucionaria. En la fiesta de Navidad de la compañía, ella y su nuevo prometido le humillan públicamente. Pero cuando un poderoso desconocido aparece en la fiesta y revela que es el desaparecido padre del empleado, los unen fuerzas para girar las tornas, y llevan a cabo una venganza navideña que nadie olvidará.","chapterCount":52,"labels":["A Nobody","Family Bonds"],"tags":["A Nobody","Family Bonds"],"typeTwoIds":[303],"typeTwoNames":["Urbano"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":303,"name":"Urbano","replaceName":"urbano"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Urbano","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"The-Lost-Heir-A-Christmas-Reckoning","bookNameLower":"the-lost-heir-a-christmas-reckoning","shelfTime":"2025-12-10 18:53:16","firstShelfTime":"2025-12-10 18:53:16","performerList":[{"performerId":"29258","performerName":"Jon Briddell","performerFormatName":"Jon-Briddell","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x5/29258/29258.jpg?time=1775038293168","videoCount":2},{"performerId":"12294","performerName":"Douglas Jung","performerFormatName":"Douglas-Jung","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x9/12294/12294.jpg?time=1790151703460","videoCount":4}],"performerIdList":[12294,29258]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700036826","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/47/5x0/50x2/502x1/50210000024/700075474_1/700075474.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795197600&Signature=cfT6ZtYRHUC~ldm8GBiUrT6lCCrz9AwULxB-mugNleBMW9DOJETgX19itQNdRHcKYK6k0pTHpiQ9i4hcOBFsXtOB4GZ-p6MKWoaJ8Wb6a85icwUFDQRfZrTkovt7fN9idakZjtcXa~ydu3iz5WA6GD78cOnZePUEhkzPiwg8~NB8